@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

### Get all order items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderitems

### Get one order item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderitems/1

### Create an order item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orderitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "OrderId": 1,
  "ItemId": 1,
  "Amount": 5,
  "UnitPrice": 12.50
}

### Delete a order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/orderitems/3